CHCheckers
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHChess (https://github.com/bateske/CHChess) and CHBlackjack
(https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack), both Apache-2.0: the input and
frame pacing (the CHGame library's chgame/Input.*, Frame.*), palette,
drawing, outlined lettering, effects, sound sequencer, flash saving, debug
protocol, the isometric board, camera and views, the pointing glove, the
play screen's flow and the PC simulator and tools, adapted here.
CHBlackjack is a derivative of "Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play
On Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5 pixel font in the CHGame library
(platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Draw.cpp) is Press Play On Tape's.

Everything else - the checkers rules and their house variants, the CPU
(Engine.*), the chips, the trays, combos and crownings, the title's tune
and the presentation - is new, under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
